{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../pin_chat_message/", "title": "pin_chat_message()"}, "next": {"link": "../unpin_all_chat_messages/", "title": "unpin_all_chat_messages()"}, "title": "unpin_chat_message()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"unpin-chat-message\">\n<h1>unpin_chat_message()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#unpin-chat-message\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.unpin_chat_message\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">unpin_chat_message</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.unpin_chat_message\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Unpin a message in a group, channel or your own chat.\nYou must be an administrator in the chat for this to work and must have the \u201ccan_pin_messages\u201d admin\nright in the supergroup or \u201ccan_edit_messages\u201d admin right in the channel.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>chat_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> | <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Unique identifier (int) or username (str) of the target chat.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>message_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Identifier of a message to unpin.\nRequired if <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">business_connection_id</span></code> is specified.\nIf not specified, the most recent pinned message (by sending date) will be unpinned.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>business_connection_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Unique identifier of the business connection on behalf of which the message will be unpinned.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code> \u2013 True on success.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unpin_chat_message</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">message_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/unpin_all_chat_messages", "unpin_all_chat_messages()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/pin_chat_message", "pin_chat_message()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">unpin_chat_message()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.unpin_chat_message\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.unpin_chat_message()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/unpin_chat_message", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}